        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ol": {
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem"
                },
                "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                  "counter-reset": "myCounter",
                  "li": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "counter-increment": "myCounter",
                      "content": "counter(myCounter)",
                      "line-height": "40px",
                      "transition": "all .2s",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "& when (@squareCounters)": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content9",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content9\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized Counters\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Square Counters\" name=\"squareCounters\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#1f6463\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">While the claims made by the Quantum Millionaire program may seem incredible at first glance, a closer examination reveals the potential underlying truths. The program's foundation lies in the understanding that our perception of life often shapes our reality. By shifting from self-limiting beliefs such as \"I am always going to stay broke\" or \"nothing good ever comes to me,\" Quantum Millionaire encourages individuals to alter their narratives. The \"Two Cups Quantum Leap\" method proposes that one's aura and energy can attract and retain positive circumstances.\n<div>\n</div><div>Here are some of the remarkable benefits this manifestation method asserts:</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ol>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>Audio Tracks -&nbsp;</b>At the heart of&nbsp; The Genius Wave are carefully designed audio sessions that use brainwave entrainment technology to encourage a state of deep relaxation, enhanced focus, and creative thinking. Each 7-minute session is crafted to help quiet mental distractions, improve concentration, and support a calmer, more productive mindset. With regular use, The Genius Wave&nbsp; is intended to help you make the most of your natural cognitive abilities and approach daily tasks with greater clarity and confidence.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">PDF Guide -</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;To help you get started with confidence, The Genius Wave includes a practical step-by-step guide featuring easy-to-follow instructions, helpful tips, and recommended listening practices. This companion resource makes it simple to build a consistent daily routine, helping you get the most value from each 7-minute audio session and maximize your overall experience.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Quick Start Bonuses -</b>&nbsp;In addition to the main program, The Genius Wave includes a selection of bonus resources designed to complement your daily listening routine. These may include creativity exercises, mindfulness practices, guided audio sessions, and other personal development materials that can help you build healthy habits, improve focus, and enhance your overall experience with the program.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Personal Support -&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">You are never alone on this path. Our dedicated support team is here to guide you, answer questions, and make sure you feel confident and supported every step of the way.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>90-Day Money-Back Promise -&nbsp;</b>Because we believe so strongly in the results, your journey begins completely risk-free. If you don't feel the benefits within 90 days, you'll receive a full refund no pressure, no worries.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>The Genius Wave isn't just a program - </b>It's a partner in your personal growth. With every listen, you are taking a step closer to greater clarity, creativity, and confidence in every part of your life.</span></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li>\n                    </ol>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
