        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ol": {
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem"
                },
                "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                  "counter-reset": "myCounter",
                  "li": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "counter-increment": "myCounter",
                      "content": "counter(myCounter)",
                      "line-height": "40px",
                      "transition": "all .2s",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "& when (@squareCounters)": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content9",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content9\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized Counters\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Square Counters\" name=\"squareCounters\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#1f6463\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">While the claims made by the Quantum Millionaire program may seem incredible at first glance, a closer examination reveals the potential underlying truths. The program's foundation lies in the understanding that our perception of life often shapes our reality. By shifting from self-limiting beliefs such as \"I am always going to stay broke\" or \"nothing good ever comes to me,\" Quantum Millionaire encourages individuals to alter their narratives. The \"Two Cups Quantum Leap\" method proposes that one's aura and energy can attract and retain positive circumstances.\n<div>\n</div><div>Here are some of the remarkable benefits this manifestation method asserts:</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ol>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><b>1. Improved Brainwave Synchronization:&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">The Genius Wave aligns your brainwave frequencies, creating a state of mental harmony. This synchronization enhances <b>overall brain performance</b>, supports cognitive health, and unlocks your true potential.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Increased Awareness and Productivity:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Users experience heightened awareness and sharper perception of their surroundings. This leads to <b>improved efficiency, proactive decision-making,</b> and greater productivity in daily tasks.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Stress and Anxiety Reduction:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">The soothing audio frequencies naturally place the brain in a relaxed yet focused state. This helps <b>reduce stress and anxiety,</b> making it ideal for both high-performance work sessions and restful downtime.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Boosted Creativity and Problem-Solving:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">By stimulating theta brainwaves, The Genius Wave unlocks <b>creative thinking and enhances problem-solving abilities.</b> Users often report generating fresh, innovative ideas with ease.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Positive Emotional Balance:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">The program promotes <b>emotional stability,</b> fostering feelings of calmness, positivity, and overall well-being. This helps users approach lifeâ€™s challenges with greater resilience and confidence.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Increased Mental Clarity:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">The Genius Wave clears away mental fog, sharpening thought processes and decision-making abilities. It creates the <b>clarity needed to focus, plan,</b> and execute with precision.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Enhanced Learning and Memory:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">By optimizing brain function, the program makes it easier to retain <b>information, strengthen memory, and accelerate learning.</b> Itâ€™s perfect for students, professionals, and lifelong learners.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Deep Relaxation:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Through advanced soundwave technologyâ€”such as <b>binaural beats and isochronic tones</b>â€”The Genius Wave promotes profound relaxation, effectively <b>reducing stress and mental fatigue.</b></span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Heightened Focus and Concentration:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">The program strengthens mental clarity and concentration, allowing users to<b> remain focused on tasks </b>without distraction. This results in higher productivity and <b>improved performance.</b></span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Overall Well-Being:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">By harmonizing relaxation and focus, The Genius Wave supports <b>mental, emotional, and even physical health</b>. It provides a holistic approach to self-improvement and personal transformation.</span></li></ol><ol><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li>\n                    </ol>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
